# Teaching readiness — Creación Digital I–II (UEM)

**Audited 2026-08-11** against emancipated repo layout + official guía JSON clones.

---

## 0. Straight answer

**CD I: not yet teachable.** Track pages are scaffold; no forged units bound to the guía hour table.

**CD II: not yet teachable** beyond naming official CONTENIDOS and the vShowroom role.

**Institutional contract: cloned.** `cv/guides/1-creacion-digital-i.json` · `cv/guides/3-creacion-digital-ii.json` + [`oficial-guia-framework.mdc`](./oficial-guia-framework.mdc). All forging must close to those tables.

**Research / grounding layer: extraction + vectors live.** Ahmes 43/43; DevIAC ingest 43/43 (`profield-digital-creativity`). **Cite nodes, not snippets.**

**Product layer (vShowroom): specified cross-repo.** Web Atelier `atelier-synergy-vshowroom.mdc`.

