## 2. Path to ready — ordered

**Wave 0 — institutional honesty**
1. PDF-check CD I evaluation weights; document the fix in `cv/README.md`.
2. Allocate session hours in `tracks.yml` with official keys; close to 140 h (CD I) / 150 h (CD II) presencial.
3. Consent / authorship templates (exhibition gate).

**Wave 1 — forge** via [`dc-unit-forge.mdc`](./dc-unit-forge.mdc) against CONTENIDOS anchors in the framework.  
**Wave 2 — CV drafts** via [`dc-cv-forge.mdc`](./dc-cv-forge.mdc).  
**Wave 3 — decks** after prose settles.

**Minimum viable first class:** Wave 0 + one forged CD I unit (volume/3D or 2D intro) + one CD II studio brief on portfolio/web with vShowroom ingest named.

---

## 3. What would change the answer to “ready”

- Full triad (B1·B2·B3) per first units, EN+ES, anchors ⊆ JSON.
- Hour sums close; evaluation tables match JSON/PDF.
- Consent path usable before any public piece.
